                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“Courtney has a gift for going with the medicine of what’s needed in doing one phone session my body was tingling and warm, my heart stopped hurting. There’s was a tenderness to it but it was the tenderness of the internal mother not of the little girl who is so sacred and hurting. Courtneys gifts are powerful, leading from her heart she is able to bring forth exactly the love, strength, tenderness and wisdom needed. She has extraordinary gifts, my energy is completely shifted and uplifted.”"
