                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“There is an opening within ourselves that can only happen when we are met with the innocence that we are. Courtney is one of a rare few spiritual leaders that I have experienced capable of meeting her clients in such a pristine field. She has served to liberate not only my voice but also my evolution into a higher level of integrity and authentic leadership. Armed with an arsenal of modalities, her true authority comes from her capacity of holding a pure state of love that is aligned with my understanding of Christed consciousness.”"
